---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service & Usage Policy | ImageLabKit"
  description="Terms of service governing your use of ImageLabKit's free browser-based image, PDF, text, graphics, and OCR tools."
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pb-14 space-y-8 animate-fade-up">
    <header>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400 mb-2">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-zinc-950">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-2">Last updated: November 24, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="studio-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6 text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-950">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using ImageLabKit, you agree to these Terms of Service. All tools are
          provided free of charge for lawful personal, educational, and commercial workflows.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-950">2. Your Files &amp; Ownership</h2>
        <p>
          You retain 100% ownership and copyright over all images, PDFs, graphics, and text you
          process through ImageLabKit. You are solely responsible for ensuring you have the right to
          edit, convert, or extract text from any files you open.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-950">3. Fair Use &amp; Service Availability</h2>
        <p>
          Automated abuse, scraping, or excessive scripted traffic against our serverless OCR API
          (<code>/api/ocr</code>) is prohibited and may be rate-limited. Tools are provided
          &ldquo;as is&rdquo; without warranties; always verify critical output (such as official
          portal photos, redacted documents, or OCR transcriptions) before final submission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-950">4. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms as new tools are introduced. Continued use of ImageLabKit after
          updates constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
